{"ref":"BDB, עַקּוּב","hw":"עַקּוּב","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עַקּוּב</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> 𝔊B usually (Ι)ακουν[μ], A 𝔊 L Ακ(κ)ουβ:—<br><strong>1.</strong>  descendant of David <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:24\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.24\">1 Ch 3:24</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  heads of post-exilic families: <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:43\" href=\"/Ezra.2.43\">Ezr 2:42</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:44\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.44\">Ne 7:45</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:45\" href=\"/Ezra.2.45\">Ezr 2:45</a> (si vera l.).<br><strong>3.</strong>  Levites: <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:17\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.17\">1 Ch 9:17</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 8:7\" href=\"/Nehemiah.8.7\">Ne 8:7</a>. <strong>c.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:19\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.19\">Ne 11:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:25\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.25\">12:25</a>.","next":"BDB, יַעֲקֹב²","prev":"BDB, עֵ֫קֶב"}